      "id": "claim_d814b8003562488693bc34de5d704d70",
      "statement": "WebSocketEnvelope (aliased BrijioEnvelope) is the universal frame: type is always the literal 'message', an optional string id correlation id, an optional target carrying per-call browserInstanceId and tabId, and an untyped payload discriminated by payload.type; BrijioErrorEnvelope frames use type 'error' and are distinct from per-action ok:false responses.",
