      "statement": "BrijioRole distinguishes the two connection kinds ('extension' and 'mcp'); AuthPayload requires role to be one of those literals and a non-empty token, AuthSuccessPayload is the 'auth_success' reply, and createAuthEnvelope is overloaded to accept a bare token (defaulting role to extension) or an explicit {requestId, token, role} object.",
