      "statement": "BrowserPresence carries browserInstanceId, label, browserName, profileName, optional connection timestamps, and a capabilities array; isBrowserPresenceAnnouncePayload strictly requires non-empty instance/label/browser/profile fields and a capabilities array of valid BrowserCapability values, which is the guard the relay relies on for discovery.",
