      "statement": "BrowserCapability is a fixed literal union matching browser feature flags to their request payload.type names (page_context, page_content, click, fill_input, fill_editable, set_checked, select_options, submit_form, navigate, batch, upload_file, download_status, download_file, fetch_resource, screenshot); isBrowserCapability is the exhaustive literal guard.",
