      "statement": "Batch requests are capped at BATCH_MAX_ACTIONS (20) with a minimum of one action; isPerformBatchEnvelope enforces the 1-20 bound and validates each action via the same per-action guards used for single perform_action requests, and hasValidApprovalMetadata validates optional actionUUID/approvalRequest fields on every action.",
