      "statement": "File upload staging is a separate chunked flow keyed by uploadId with stages start/chunk/complete plus ack and error payloads; the error.code is typed to invalid_file_payload, checksum_mismatch, file_too_large, invalid_file_name, invalid_file_type, or upload_expired, and the ack/error envelopes make target optional so they can route back without a target.",
